{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Preserve immediate durable suspension.** The already-selected `outcome` is not read until `invokeHandler()` exits. If the handler catches the control-flow error or blocks in `finally`, `execute()` never returns PENDING/RETRYING and Lambda runs until timeout, even without plugins. Drive the response from `runUntilCompleteOrSuspend` and make same-thread cleanup a bounded handoff, failing or retrying before the Lambda deadline if the handler cannot unwind.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77KBY1","finding_digest":"d34970da8c622b783e59c3d63971052058c1ab1e1e5ea29410929a444e633510","finding_id":"arf_v1_2nexbwummivxqpszyplds4ifeb","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::suspension-liveness","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::suspension-liveness","line":126,"observation_digest":"f42a1cc87a51ce0bb3c504373fcbf5609439ca6811830f7655c167fc1941caba","observation_id":"aro_v1_6qvbzsd2khhaxm6faq3t7s7vmc","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2nexbwummivxqpszyplds4ifeb","published_at":"2026-10-08T01:29:20Z","review_id":"arr_v1_nkiq5tjniw4p27rjtuhhmygruq","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"4f421deeed701315e1534fe2cc14ab78cd8eb482","reviewer":"codex","start_line":126,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_xtmgf722q2i7fxvx36od7ri4we","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T01:29:20Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
